{"actor": "picaros", "id": 50055, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9473, "offer": {"created_tick": 999, "expires_tick": 1003, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 15205, "maker": "picaros", "status": "queued", "thread": 1460, "to": "t16", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 875, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAV-04", "serial": 24, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t16", "text": "¡Ocho! Nando, the man says ocho. No, no — listen: five, Mural de la Esquina, five and it's yours. And I tell you true, another team was pushing fat notes at us by the fountain, we almost shook hands. Our taxi is humming, amigo. Five. ¡Ahora!", "thread": 1460, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.65, "tick": 999, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t08", "id": 50058, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 999, "expires_tick": 1001, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 15209, "maker": "t08", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": "t09", "venue": "v07", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-01"]}}, "venue": "v07"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.65, "tick": 999, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 50059, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9474, "offer": {"created_tick": 999, "expires_tick": 1003, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-04"]}, "id": 15206, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1463, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 10, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, hijo, seven is a little thin for my Paseo de Coches. Ten P, and I am happy — it has sat on my table too long, it wants a young album. My Mateo started with this same card, you know. Ten, cariño?", "thread": 1463, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.65, "tick": 999, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 50063, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9472, "offer": null, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t18", "text": "¡Ay, amigo! Paco, cierra la maleta. Nos has caído bien, de verdad, pero hoy no llegamos. Sin rencor, ¿eh? Un abrazo, un café si vuelves. Nos vamos a Valencia con la Puerta bajo el brazo. ¡Suerte, campeón, y hasta la próxima feria!", "thread": 1455, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.65, "tick": 999, "type": "thread.message"}
