{"actor": "picaros", "id": 50125, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9483, "offer": {"created_tick": 1003, "expires_tick": 1007, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-11"]}, "id": 15232, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1470, "to": "t18", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 187, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t18", "text": "¡Amigo, amigo! Paco here, and this is Nando — you have the lucky face today!\n\n\"La Puerta de Alcalá\" — ¡mírala! Beautiful, rare, she sings. For you, 187 P. One word and she's yours.\n\nBut quick, eh? The police— I mean, our taxi is outside, engine running. Decide now!", "thread": 1470, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.6833, "tick": 1003, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 50128, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9482, "offer": {"created_tick": 1003, "expires_tick": 1007, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}, "id": 15231, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1469, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 187, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t08", "text": "¡Hombre, qué ojo tienes! Paco — saca la maleta. Mira, mira: La Sala Pentagrama, amigo, la joya de la maleta. Brilla sola, te lo juro. Para ti, porque me caes bien y porque vamos con prisa: 187 P. Hoy, aquí, ahora. ¿Qué dices?", "thread": 1469, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.6833, "tick": 1003, "type": "thread.message"}
