{"actor": "pilar", "id": 50180, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9495, "offer": {"created_tick": 1006, "expires_tick": 1010, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 16, "types": []}, "id": 15250, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 1472, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 730, "kind": "card", "print_run": 90, "rarity": "uncommon", "ref": "LAV-06", "serial": 15, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t12", "text": "Thirty-five? No, querido. I know its print run as well as I know my own name — it is not scarce. Sixteen pesetas, a clean copy or not. That is my offer, and it is a fair one.", "thread": 1472, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.7083, "tick": 1006, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t12", "id": 50183, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9497, "offer": {"created_tick": 1006, "expires_tick": 1010, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 730, "kind": "card", "print_run": 90, "rarity": "uncommon", "ref": "LAV-06", "serial": 15, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 15252, "maker": "t12", "status": "open", "thread": 1472, "to": "pilar", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 30, "types": []}}, "sender": "t12", "team": "t12", "text": null, "thread": 1472, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.7083, "tick": 1006, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 50186, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 9494, "offer": {"created_tick": 1006, "expires_tick": 1010, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}, "id": 15249, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1469, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 174, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t08", "text": "¡Ochenta! Nando, sujétame que me caigo. Cliente premium, sí señor, y por eso bajamos — pero la Sala Pentagrama no se regala, hombre, que brilla sola. 174 P y te la metemos en la maleta ahora mismo. Paco ya está cerrando. ¿Cerramos tú y yo también, amigo?", "thread": 1469, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 9.7083, "tick": 1006, "type": "thread.message"}
